# demo: in-repo
# demo: config
# demo: it-next=pass
Output gifs/tui-run.gif
Output text/tui-run.txt
Set Height 720
Source tapes/_common.tape
Source tapes/_start.tape
Hide
Type "cd ~/setlist-service && clear"
Enter
Show
Type "bam"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type ":presets"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "j"
Sleep 600ms
Type "R"
Sleep 2s
Tab
Sleep 600ms
Space
Sleep 800ms
Space
Sleep 800ms
Type "d"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Ctrl+R
Sleep 8s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
